OL,3,ARussian arrested for spying on US
OL,4,Adefence company Palantir over Ukraine
OL,5,Asupport
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian man has been arrested in
OL,8,FCalifornia's Silicon Valley for
OL,9,Fallegedly attempting to spy on
OL,10,Femployees of a technology and defence
OL,11,Ffirm that supports the Ukrainian
OL,12,Fmilitary.
OL,14,FIgor D'iu is accused of acting as an
OL,15,Fagent of a foreign government to
OL,16,Fconduct a covert operation in Palo
OL,17,FAlto, near San Francisco. The BBC
OL,18,Funderstands that the company targeted
OL,19,Fwas Palantir Technologies.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
