OL,3,ARussian arrested for spying on US
OL,4,Adefence company Palantir over Ukraine
OL,5,Asupport
OL,6,
OL,7,FD'iu is also charged with stalking
OL,8,Femployees and possessing falsified
OL,9,Fidentity documents.
OL,11,FThe company is not named in charging
OL,12,Fdocuments, but is described as a
OL,13,Fpublicly traded technology and defence
OL,14,Fcompany that produces software used by
OL,15,FUkraine in its war with Russia.
